00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.360
Well, I'm sure we're one of them.

106
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.020
We are.

107
00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:42.520
We're one of the eight.

108
00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:52.820
They are Marshall Islands, Micronesia, Nauru, Palau, Papua New Guinea, Suriname, Tonga,

109
00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.440
and the United States.

110
00:04:55.120 --> 00:05:02.640
All of the other 187 countries in the world guarantee some kind of paid family leave.

