114
00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:14.260
In 1993, we passed the Family and Medical Leave Act, and that allows you to take up

115
00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:22.000
to 12 weeks of unpaid leave when you foster, adopt, or have a child, or in case of illness

116
00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:26.400
or a health condition whereby you can't work or if you need to care for an immediate family

117
00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:26.780
member.

118
00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.120
It just means you can't be fired.

119
00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.340
This is what I applied for when I had my son.

120
00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.520
I took leave from the office under this law.

121
00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.540
