173
00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.380
I am a native Floridian.

174
00:07:54.660 --> 00:08:00.260
I grew up in Miami until I was 18, then moved to Tallahassee to attend Florida State University

175
00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:04.820
and ended up living there for 11 years until I moved to New Mexico in late 2020.

176
00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:11.480
I noticed that all of Dunder Mifflin thinks that all of Florida is the same, and they assume

177
00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:13.460
Tallahassee will be just like Miami.

178
00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:16.160
But let me tell you, the two could not be more different.

179
00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:20.740
Tallahassee is a medium-sized, quiet, southern college town.

180
00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:24.980
There are giant oak trees with Spanish moss and hardly any palm trees.

181
00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:30.020
And while there aren't four distinct seasons, Tallahassee can get very cold in the winter

182
00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:30.420
months.

183
00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:35.000
So here are just a few things I noticed in Special Project that made me think Dunder

184
00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:40.060
Mifflin assumes all of Florida is the same or that they will be actually in Miami.

185
00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:43.620
