186
00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:47.280
February in Tallahassee is not pool or beach weather.

187
00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:51.000
The closest beach to Tallahassee is almost 40 miles away.

188
00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:55.740
