190
00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.740
That is 309 miles away from Tallahassee.

191
00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:04.100
Oh, dear.

192
00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:10.580
He mentions Gloria Estefan, who lives in Miami, which is 482 miles away.

193
