1350
00:58:14.560 --> 00:58:15.920
But none of that happened.

1351
00:58:15.920 --> 00:58:18.280
I know, because it's all cut out.

1352
00:58:19.160 --> 00:58:22.400
So it does seem out of absolute left field.

1353
00:58:22.620 --> 00:58:22.880
Yeah.

1354
00:58:23.640 --> 00:58:25.040
That's how I felt about it.

1355
00:58:25.080 --> 00:58:25.260
Yeah.

1356
00:58:25.400 --> 00:58:26.200
It didn't feel earned.

1357
00:58:26.400 --> 00:58:29.460
